              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Pulled by two horses, crewed by a driver and a noble warrior (sword, javelins, light armour, shield). Light chariots as in the WAB rulebook. Not subject to Warband Psychology. Squadrons of at least three models. With opponent's permission use the Ancient Briton chariot rules from AoA p.47. (Hannibal p.81)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
